## Approach

Add category-based filtering to `query_for_context()` so language-specific lessons only surface in workspaces that use those languages, while technology and uncategorized lessons surface everywhere. The store path already handles categories (schema, `StoreLessonParams`, `RememberArgs`); this task fills the query-side gap.

The filtering uses a known-languages const to distinguish language categories (e.g. "rust", "dart") from technology categories (e.g. "sqlite", "concurrency"). A lesson passes if it has no categories, has any non-language category, or has a language category matching the workspace.

