## Steps

### Step 1: Add `Db::distinct_languages()`

Add a method to get the set of languages present in the workspace file index.

```rust
// src/db/mod.rs
pub fn distinct_languages(&self) -> Result<Vec<String>> {
    let conn = self.conn.lock();
    let mut stmt = conn.prepare(
        "SELECT DISTINCT language FROM files"
    )?;
    let langs = stmt.query_map([], |row| row.get(0))?
        .collect::<std::result::Result<Vec<String>, _>>()?;
    Ok(langs)
}
```

